; THE GREENWASH SWARM'S HAZE, TINTED GREEN. The author playtested the Naga (2026-09-23) and asked for
; "a mild green tint" on the Charging Swarm.
;
; THIS FILE IS res://content/fx_endless/gear/aura/fxe_nanites.tscn WITH ONE PROPERTY CHANGED - the
; ParticleProcessMaterial's `color` - exactly as the Myconid's fxe_fungal_network.tscn is. Read that
; file's header for why it is a new file at a new path under res/content/ (the vanilla scene is shared
; with the Hive Drone, and the vanilla PATH would replace rather than add) and why the id is the
; basename: RENAMING THIS FILE CHANGES THE FXE ID and silently stops the haze drawing.

