; THE ONE LINE THIS FILE EXISTS FOR. The Naga's green is mf_naga.tres base_2,
; Color(0.32156864, 0.7529412, 0.5921569). The fungal network's method, then halved for "mild":
;   1. scale base_2 to vanilla's channel mean 0.26666668 (k = 0.48): (0.15435295, 0.36141178, 0.28423531)
;   2. blend that 50/50 with vanilla's grey 0.26666668: (0.21050982, 0.31403923, 0.27545100)
; Channel mean stays 0.26666668, so the haze keeps vanilla's weight and only its hue moves (~140
; degrees, saturation ~0.33). For more green, step 1's triple is the full-strength version.
color = Color(0.21050982, 0.31403923, 0.275451, 1)

